{
 "slug": "css3_flexbox_container",
 "course": "css",
 "order": 172,
 "url": "/css/css3_flexbox_container.asp",
 "title": "CSS Flex Container",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h1",
   "text": "CSS Flex Container"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS Flex Container Properties"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The flex container element can have the following properties:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "display - Must be set to flex or inline-flex",
    "flex-direction - Sets the display-direction of flex items",
    "flex-wrap - Specifies whether the flex items should wrap or not",
    "flex-flow - Shorthand property for  flex-direction and flex-wrap",
    "justify-content - Aligns the flex items when they do not use all available space on the main-axis (horizontally)",
    "align-items - Aligns the flex items when they do not use all available space on the cross-axis (vertically)",
    "align-content - Aligns the flex lines when there is extra space in the cross axis and flex items wrap"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS flex-direction Property"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The flex-direction property specifies the display-direction of flex items in the flex container."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "This property can have one of the following values:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "row (default)",
    "column",
    "row-reverse",
    "column-reverse"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-direction: row;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-direction_row"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-direction: column;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-direction_column"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-direction: row-reverse;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-direction_row-reverse"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-direction: column-reverse;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-direction_column-reverse"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS flex-wrap Property"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The flex-wrap property specifies whether the flex items should wrap or not,\nif there is not enough room for them on one flex line."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "This property can have one of the following values:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "nowrap (default)",
    "wrap",
    "wrap-reverse"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-wrap: nowrap;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-wrap_nowrap"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-wrap_wrap"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-wrap: wrap-reverse;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-wrap_wrap-reverse"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS flex-flow Property"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The flex-flow property is a shorthand property for setting both the\nflex-direction and\nflex-wrap properties."
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": ".flex-container {\n\n  display: flex;\n\n  flex-flow: row wrap;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss3_flexbox_flex-flow_row_wrap"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Flex Container Subpages"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Continue learning about flex container properties:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "justify-content - horizontal alignment of flex items",
    "align-items & align-content - vertical alignment and true centering"
   ]
  }
 ]
}